{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25463","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 月桂 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 月桂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何年霜夜月，桂子落寒山。\n翠干生岩下，金英在世间。\n幽崖空自老，清汉未知还。\n惟有凉秋夜，嫦娥来暂攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}